# FamilyTree — cloud configuration (Milestone 1)
#
# Copy to `.env.local` and fill in to enable "Continue with Google".
# WITHOUT THESE, FAMILYTREE WORKS EXACTLY AS IT ALWAYS HAS: everything is
# kept on this device, and no account is offered. That is a supported
# configuration, not a broken one.
#
# Both come from your Supabase project under Settings -> API. The anon key
# is a public identifier and is safe in a browser bundle; everything it can
# reach is gated by row-level security on the server.
#
# NEVER put a service-role key here or anywhere else in this application.
# It bypasses row-level security entirely.

VITE_SUPABASE_URL=
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
